    <main>
      <section class="case-hero deep-dive-hero">
        <div>
          <a class="back-link en" href="case-mokafx.html">← Moka SFX overview</a>
          <a class="back-link zh" href="case-mokafx.html">← 返回 Moka SFX 概览</a>
          <span class="tag">Paid Media Efficiency</span>
          <h1 class="en">Tracing invalid leads back to wasted ad spend.</h1>
          <h1 class="zh">从无效询盘反推广告浪费。</h1>
          <p class="body-copy en">
            Moka SFX's advertising conversions included a significant number of inquiries unrelated to its products. I traced invalid leads back to their sources and built a continuously updated exclusion system across Search, Display, and Video campaigns. Monthly ad spend fell by approximately 33% while qualified lead volume and quality remained stable.
          </p>
          <p class="body-copy zh">
            Moka SFX 的广告转化中包含大量与产品无关的需求。我从真实询盘出发，追踪无效线索的广告来源，并针对搜索、展示和视频广告建立持续更新的排除机制。在有效询盘保持稳定的情况下，月度广告支出降低约 33%。
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="case-meta">
          <span class="en"><strong>My Role:</strong> B2B SEO &amp; SEM Strategist</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Market:</strong> International B2B Stage Equipment</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Period:</strong> May–September 2025</span>
          <span class="en"><strong>Data Source:</strong> Google Ads &amp; lead inquiry records</span>
          <span class="zh"><strong>我的职责：</strong>B2B SEO 与 SEM Strategist</span>
          <span class="zh"><strong>市场：</strong>国际 B2B 舞台设备</span>
          <span class="zh"><strong>周期：</strong>2025.05–2025.09</span>
          <span class="zh"><strong>数据来源：</strong>Google Ads 与询盘记录</span>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="workflow-section">
        <div class="workflow-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Workflow</p>
          <h2 class="en">From lead feedback to campaign exclusions.</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">从询盘反馈到广告排除。</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow en">
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">01</span>
            <h2>Business Problem</h2>
            <p>Inquiries about app development, gaming, support services, and other unrelated requests wasted budget and increased sales screening.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">02</span>
            <h2>Data Diagnosis</h2>
            <p>I classified invalid leads, traced their campaign sources, and reviewed search terms, locations, audiences, websites, apps, and placements.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">03</span>
            <h2>Cause Assessment</h2>
            <p>Invalid traffic was distributed across campaign types without a continuously updated negative-keyword and placement-exclusion system.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">04</span>
            <h2>Optimization</h2>
            <p>I used AI-assisted classification in Google Sheets and Looker Studio, then excluded irrelevant terms, websites, apps, and placements.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">05</span>
            <h2>Validation &amp; Learning</h2>
            <p>Qualified leads remained stable as spend fell, creating a repeatable feedback loop between lead quality and campaign settings.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow zh">
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">01</span>
            <h2>业务问题</h2>
            <p>部分询盘涉及 App 开发、游戏、帮助服务及其他无关需求，既浪费预算，也增加销售筛选成本。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">02</span>
            <h2>数据诊断</h2>
            <p>标记无效线索并追踪广告来源，分别检查搜索词、地域、受众、网站、App 和展示位置。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">03</span>
            <h2>原因判断</h2>
            <p>无效流量分散在多种广告类型中，账户缺少持续更新的否定关键词和展示位置排除机制。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">04</span>
            <h2>优化执行</h2>
            <p>使用 Google Sheets 的 AI 辅助分类和 Looker Studio 识别来源，批量排除无关词、网站、App 和展示位置。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="workflow-step">
            <span class="workflow-number">05</span>
            <h2>结果验证与复盘</h2>
            <p>有效询盘保持稳定、支出下降，并形成“询盘质量—广告来源—排除设置”的持续反馈机制。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="evidence-section">
        <div class="evidence-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow en">Measured Outcome</p>
          <p class="eyebrow zh">结果验证</p>
          <h2 class="en">Lower spend without sacrificing qualified leads.</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">降低支出，同时保持有效询盘。</h2>
          <p class="en">AI supported the classification process; the core improvement was the feedback loop connecting real inquiry quality with advertising sources and campaign exclusions.</p>
          <p class="zh">AI 只用于辅助分类，真正的核心是把真实询盘质量、广告来源和排除设置连接成持续优化闭环。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="evidence-metrics">
          <div class="evidence-row"><span class="en">Monthly ad spend</span><span class="zh">月度广告支出</span><strong>$8.6K → $5.7K</strong></div>
          <div class="evidence-row"><span class="en">Invalid inquiries in comparable monthly periods</span><span class="zh">相同月度周期内无效询盘</span><strong>800 → 600</strong></div>
          <div class="evidence-row"><span class="en">Qualified lead volume and quality</span><span class="zh">有效询盘数量与质量</span><strong class="en">Stable</strong><strong class="zh">保持稳定</strong></div>
          <div class="evidence-row"><span class="en">Qualified leads from a new ad group</span><span class="zh">新建广告组有效线索</span><strong>7</strong></div>
        </div>
      </section>

